not be shattered beyond all repair."}],"variants":false,"sections":[{"zh":"这颗小行星的表面覆盖满了被其低重力束缚的机器人碎片。看起来它们都是由军事行动造成的。如果这些作战机器人没有被破坏到无法修复的话，本来是足够武装几只军队的。","en":"The entire surface of this small asteroid is covered in robot debris, trapped in its weak gravity field. All of it appears military in nature, and there are enough combat droids here to outfit several armies had they not be shattered beyond all repair."}],"image":"art/07afcc0b4413be450471.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"story.5","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-d79be02ee66eff75"},{"target":"ancrel.6250","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"stage","story":"story-b2ca97e8ae919327"},{"target":"ancrel.6255","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"stage","story":"story-b2ca97e8ae919327"},{"target":"ancrel.6260","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"stage","story":"story-b2ca97e8ae919327"},{"target":"ancrel.8040","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-5b4eb66c89c75c3c"},{"target":"ancrel.8045","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-f78299c220710f63"},{"target":"ancrel.8050","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-cba2039fc19c8af5"},{"target":"ancrel.8055","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ad0897f096e097ee"},{"target":"ancrel.8060","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-d4ad771b5743376e"},{"target":"ancrel.8065","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ef966c4f797fc0af"},{"target":"ancrel.8070","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-fb9da13e3a100283"},{"target":"ancrel.8075","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-3b68bd1ccfec6c9e"},{"target":"ancrel.8080","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-34b742ed2c428c28"},{"target":"ancrel.8110","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-b35ef28fa71d32bb"},{"target":"federations2.701","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-f2e82278abe4f8be"},{"target":"ancrel.4078","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-cfa4bd3f09d80e63"},{"target":"ancrel.13030","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c890a17af41d060d"},{"target":"ancrel.4006","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-7f3c5ad9feeda661"},{"target":"ancrel.4021","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-5a481201d36380f7"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-218525577af36234"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-f62ff62ba6dd0b5b"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-c7f587d12cf522a6"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-6e1382d8e45d1610"},{"target":"ancrel.8010","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-39c7db7f741ce109"},{"target":"ancrel.8011","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-fff240d4023cd248"},{"target":"ancrel.8012","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-ecfb4d9b31e681c3"},{"target":"ancrel.8013","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-623bdd6bec1d651e"},{"target":"ancrel.8020","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-568ea5f0179aeced"},{"target":"ancrel.8021","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-025a0a7c150defe0"},{"target":"ancrel.8022","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-b49f85fc95d5e21a"},{"target":"ancrel.8023","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-0212600ef25438c4"},{"target":"ancrel.8030","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-f791811eb1ae04f0"},{"target":"ancrel.8031","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-619c47ca6033bfab"},{"target":"ancrel.8032","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-983dbe8a0d4123cd"},{"target":"ancrel.8033","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-a2c4fd1287f7aaf5"},{"target":"ancrel.8090","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-dcbf749527fdd382"},{"target":"ancrel.8091","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-cc90c1dc133cd22a"},{"target":"ancrel.8092","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-bd907480b34fc043"},{"target":"ancrel.8093","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-b6990f22401ffca8"},{"target":"ancrel.8100","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-abe6c93e9ba79d94"},{"target":"ancrel.8101","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-119d6e320e24449b"},{"target":"ancrel.8102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-b083ff7ad43a1502"},{"target":"ancrel.8103","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-51397d56bf8fc81c"}],"readings":[]},{"id":"ancrel.6250","title":{"zh":"两个来源","en":"Two Sides"},"texts":[{"zh":"在仔细检查后，在[From.Planet.GetName]表面发现的机器人碎片似乎来自两种截然不同的文化。从技术上来说，这些机器人在能正常工作时其各部件间一定会完全匹配，但是许多微妙的差异暗示他们不是源自同一设计。","en":"Upon closer examination, the smashed droids found on the surface of [From.Planet.GetName] appear to originate from two distinct cultures. Technologically the droids must have been evenly matched when they were still functional, but there are many subtle differences that hint at different design origins."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/f2c8b72b42b186a8e31d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"ancrel.6255","title":{"zh":"战场","en":"Battlefield"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.Planet.GetName]似乎不仅仅简单的是一个机器人碎片的垃圾场——这颗小行星可能是这些机器人被破坏的战场。多层碎片暗示在过去的两个世纪中断断续续发生了许多场非常激烈的战争。\n\n为什么两个星际大国会因为在一个不起眼的小行星上大打出手仍然是一个未解之谜。","en":"[From.Planet.GetName] does not seem to have simply been a dumping ground for broken droids - it may have served as the actual battlefield where they were destroyed. The many layers of debris suggest a series of very intense battles waged intermittently across the better part of two centuries.\n\nExactly why two interstellar powers would commit such vast resources towards waging a massive ground war on a small and unremarkable asteroid remains an unanswered question."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/9dd0e3e6ffcf359310be.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"ancrel.6260","title":{"zh":"条约","en":"The Treaty"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的考古学家已经了解到，在经历了一场漫长而艰苦的战争之后，居住在星系这一角落的两个帝国在大约20万年前签署了一项条约，要求他们用机器人军队之间安排好的、高度管制的战斗来解决所有未来的争端。\n\n[From.Planet.GetName]被选为这些战斗的地点。该条约似乎已维持了将近两个世纪，多次阻止了武装敌对行动的爆发，直到其中一个帝国被发现作弊为止。","en":"Our archaeologists have learned that after a long and bitter war, the two empires inhabiting this corner of the galaxy some 200,000 years ago signed a treaty compelling them to settle all future disputes with arranged and highly regulated combat engagements between robotic armies.\n\n[From.Planet.GetName] was chosen as the site of these battles. The treaty appears to have been upheld for nearly two centuries, preventing the outbreak of armed hostilities on numerous occasions, until one of the empires was caught cheating."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/d63f9361bc2bc9cdd5ab.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]}]}